#: docs/usage.rst:2
msgid "Camera workflows"
msgstr "相机使用流程"

#: docs/usage.rst:5
msgid "SDK capture"
msgstr "SDK 采集"

#: docs/usage.rst:7
msgid ""
"Camera methods that perform SDK operations return an "
":class:`~mecheye.shared.ErrorStatus`. Check it before reading a frame. Capture "
"timeouts and heartbeat intervals are expressed in milliseconds."
msgstr "执行 SDK 操作的相机方法返回 :class:`~mecheye.shared.ErrorStatus`。读取帧前应检查状态。采集超时和心跳间隔的单位均为毫秒。"

#: docs/usage.rst:28
msgid ""
"SDK calls do not connect lazily or retry failures. ``disconnect()`` returns ``None``."
" Camera copies share the same native connection and event context, so disconnecting "
"one copy affects the others."
msgstr "SDK 调用不会延迟连接或重试失败。``disconnect()`` 返回 ``None``。相机副本共享原生连接和事件上下文，因此断开一个副本也会影响其他副本。"

#: docs/usage.rst:33
msgid "Aligned NumPy capture"
msgstr "对齐的 NumPy 采集"

#: docs/usage.rst:35
msgid ""
":meth:`~mecheye.area_scan_3d_camera.Camera.capture_points` combines depth-source 2D "
"and 3D capture with mapping and grayscale conversion. This workflow requires a camera"
" model that supports depth-source 2D capture."
msgstr ""
":meth:`~mecheye.area_scan_3d_camera.Camera.capture_points` 将深度源 2D 与 3D "
"采集、映射及灰度转换组合起来。此流程要求相机型号支持深度源 2D 采集。"

#: docs/usage.rst:49
msgid ""
"``image`` is an owned ``uint8`` array with shape ``(height, width)``. ``points_mm`` "
"is an owned ``float64`` array with shape ``(height, width, 3)``. SDK all-zero points "
"become NaN triplets, and non-finite coordinate components become NaN. The previous "
"SDK cloud unit is restored after success or failure; a restoration failure raises "
":class:`~mecheye.shared.MechEyeConfigurationError`."
msgstr ""
"``image`` 是具有独立存储的 ``uint8`` 数组，形状为 ``(height, width)``。``points_mm`` 是具有独立存储的 "
"``float64`` 数组，形状为 ``(height, width, 3)``。SDK 全零点转换为三个 NaN，非有限坐标分量转换为 "
"NaN。无论成功与否，都会恢复先前的 SDK 点云单位；恢复失败时抛出 "
":class:`~mecheye.shared.MechEyeConfigurationError`。"

#: docs/usage.rst:55
msgid ""
"An optional constructor IP connects only on context entry or first convenience "
"capture/configuration. Convenience failures raise subclasses of "
":class:`~mecheye.shared.MechEyeError` and do not retry automatically."
msgstr ""
"构造时可选的 IP 仅在进入上下文或首次使用便捷采集／配置功能时连接。便捷功能失败时抛出 :class:`~mecheye.shared.MechEyeError` "
"的子类异常，不会自动重试。"

