#: docs/usage.rst:90
msgid ""
"Every accessor returns an independent NumPy copy. Empty accessors return a "
"``float64`` zero array of shape ``(1,)``. Pixel references from ``at(row, col)`` or "
"indexing allow field writes; a size-changing resize or release expires them and "
"subsequent access raises ``ReferenceError``. Raw frame clouds retain the selected SDK"
" coordinate unit; only ``capture_points()`` guarantees millimeters."
msgstr ""
"每个访问方法都返回独立的 NumPy 副本。空数据返回形状为 ``(1,)`` 的 ``float64`` 零数组。``at(row, col)`` "
"或索引返回的像素引用允许修改字段；调整网格尺寸或释放数据后，这些引用会失效，后续访问抛出 ``ReferenceError``。原始帧点云保留选定的 SDK 坐标单位；仅"
" ``capture_points()`` 保证使用毫米。"

#: docs/usage.rst:96
msgid ""
"Hand-eye pose translations use millimeters when supplied as robot poses, while "
"calibrated :class:`~mecheye.area_scan_3d_camera.HandEyeTransformation` extrinsic "
"translations use meters. These units are separate from capture cloud units."
msgstr ""
"手眼标定中的机器人位姿平移使用毫米；标定得到的 :class:`~mecheye.area_scan_3d_camera.HandEyeTransformation` "
"外参平移使用米。这些单位与采集点云单位相互独立。"

#: docs/usage.rst:101
msgid "Parameters and user sets"
msgstr "参数与用户集"

#: docs/usage.rst:103
msgid ""
"Use a descriptor's ``name`` with a :class:`~mecheye.shared.UserSet`. Reads return "
"``[status, value]`` for scalar values and ``(status, value)`` for structured values. "
"Writes return an SDK status."
msgstr ""
"将描述符的 ``name`` 用于 :class:`~mecheye.shared.UserSet`。标量读取返回 ``[status, value]``，结构化读取返回"
" ``(status, value)``。写入返回 SDK 状态。"

#: docs/usage.rst:118
msgid ""
"Descriptor limits are nominal SDK metadata. Check parameter availability and device-"
"specific constraints on the connected camera before writing values. Obtain fresh "
"handles after reconnecting or selecting another user set."
msgstr "描述符的限制值属于 SDK 标称元数据。写入前应检查已连接相机上的参数可用性及设备实际约束。重新连接或选择其他用户集后，应获取新的句柄。"

#: docs/usage.rst:123
msgid "Threads, events, and output"
msgstr "线程、事件与输出"

#: docs/usage.rst:125
msgid ""
"SDK operations are serialized across camera instances and release Python thread state"
" while blocked. Explicit locks protect SDK objects in regular and free-threaded "
"CPython. Caller-owned NumPy writes and application callback state still require "
"caller synchronization."
msgstr ""
"不同相机实例的 SDK 操作会串行执行，并在阻塞期间释放 Python 线程状态。显式锁在普通和 free-threaded CPython 下保护 SDK "
"对象。调用者仍需同步对 NumPy 数组及应用回调共享状态的写入。"

#: docs/usage.rst:130
msgid ""
"For multiprocessing, prefer ``multiprocessing.get_context(\"spawn\")`` and create SDK"
" objects inside each child process. SDK calls after a fork that inherits ``mecheye`` "
"raise ``RuntimeError`` before acquiring inherited locks. Such forks are unsupported: "
"the vendor runtime can also abort during child process shutdown. To use "
"``forkserver``, call ``multiprocessing.set_forkserver_preload([])`` before starting "
"the server, so it does not preload a main module that imports ``mecheye``. Exchange "
"owned NumPy arrays between processes rather than SDK objects."
msgstr ""
"多进程推荐使用 ``multiprocessing.get_context(\"spawn\")``，在各子进程中创建 SDK 对象。若 fork 子进程继承了 "
"``mecheye``，SDK 操作会在获取继承的锁之前抛出 ``RuntimeError``。这类 fork 不受支持，厂商运行时在子进程退出时也可能中止进程。使用 "
"``forkserver`` 时，应在启动服务进程之前调用 "
"``multiprocessing.set_forkserver_preload([])``，避免服务进程预加载导入了 ``mecheye`` 的主模块。进程间传递独立 "
"NumPy 数组，不传递 SDK 对象。"

#: docs/usage.rst:130
msgid ""
"Subclass :class:`~mecheye.area_scan_3d_camera.EventCallbackBase` and register it "
"through :class:`~mecheye.area_scan_3d_camera.CameraEvent`. Event values and payloads "
"are copied before Python dispatch and can be read while a capture is running. An SDK "
"call made from a callback waits for the current SDK operation. Retrieve callback "
"failures with :meth:`~mecheye.area_scan_3d_camera.Camera.pop_callback_errors`."
msgstr ""
"继承 :class:`~mecheye.area_scan_3d_camera.EventCallbackBase`，并通过 "
":class:`~mecheye.area_scan_3d_camera.CameraEvent` 注册。事件值和载荷在 Python "
"分发前复制，因此采集期间仍可读取。回调中的 SDK 调用会等待当前 SDK 操作完成。使用 "
":meth:`~mecheye.area_scan_3d_camera.Camera.pop_callback_errors` 获取回调异常。"

#: docs/usage.rst:136
msgid ""
"The wrapper adds no automatic logging. On Linux the SDK worker silences its standard "
"output/error streams without redirecting application output. The SDK may still create"
" diagnostic files. ``show_error()`` and ``print_*()`` print only when called "
"explicitly; interactive selection helpers prompt only when called."
msgstr ""
"封装不添加自动日志。Linux 下，SDK 工作线程会静默其标准输出和标准错误，而不重定向应用输出。SDK 仍可能生成诊断文件。``show_error()`` 和 "
"``print_*()`` 仅在显式调用时打印；交互选择工具也仅在调用时提示输入。"

